{"uid": "narrative_daily_routine-3ed025efe6", "scene": "narrative_daily_routine", "scene_zh": "叙事·日常作息", "scene_en": "Narrative: Daily Routine", "group": "个人叙事", "phase": 3, "micro": "weekday", "micro_zh": "工作日", "zh": "我一般十一点上床，先看半小时书再睡。", "en": "I usually go to bed at eleven, read for half an hour first, and then sleep.", "sub": "睡前读半小时书", "angle": "frequency adverb + sequence words (first, then)", "pack": "narrative", "pattern": "narrative_daily_routine", "topic": "daily_routine", "tags": ["pack::narrative", "pattern::narrative_daily_routine", "topic::daily_routine"], "model": "qwen2.5:7b", "created_at": "2026-11-18T10:22:14+00:00"}
{"uid": "narrative_daily_routine-4c84f9c0c5", "scene": "narrative_daily_routine", "scene_zh": "叙事·日常作息", "scene_en": "Narrative: Daily Routine", "group": "个人叙事", "phase": 3, "micro": "weekend", "micro_zh": "周末", "zh": "周末我通常会打扫房间，然后去超市。", "en": "On weekends, I usually clean the house and then go to the supermarket.", "sub": "周末打扫房间", "angle": "frequency adverb + sequence words (first, then)", "pack": "narrative", "pattern": "narrative_daily_routine", "topic": "daily_routine", "tags": ["pack::narrative", "pattern::narrative_daily_routine", "topic::daily_routine"], "model": "qwen2.5:7b", "created_at": "2026-11-18T10:22:14+00:00"}
{"uid": "narrative_daily_routine-4ee36fef3e", "scene": "narrative_daily_routine", "scene_zh": "叙事·日常作息", "scene_en": "Narrative: Daily Routine", "group": "个人叙事", "phase": 3, "micro": "weekend", "micro_zh": "周末", "zh": "我一般周六上午打扫房间，下午再休息。", "en": "On Saturdays, I usually clean my room in the morning and rest in the afternoon.", "sub": "周末打扫房间", "angle": "frequency adverb + sequence words (first, then)", "pack": "narrative", "pattern": "narrative_daily_routine", "topic": "daily_routine", "tags": ["pack::narrative", "pattern::narrative_daily_routine", "topic::daily_routine"], "model": "qwen2.5:7b", "created_at": "2026-11-18T10:22:14+00:00"}
{"uid": "narrative_daily_routine-7748475ce8", "scene": "narrative_daily_routine", "scene_zh": "叙事·日常作息", "scene_en": "Narrative: Daily Routine", "group": "个人叙事", "phase": 3, "micro": "weekend", "micro_zh": "周末", "zh": "我每天通常喝两杯咖啡，早上和下午各一杯。", "en": "I usually drink two cups of coffee each day, one in the morning and one in the afternoon.", "sub": "每天喝两杯咖啡", "angle": "frequency adverb + sequence words (first, then)", "pack": "narrative", "pattern": "narrative_daily_routine", "topic": "daily_routine", "tags": ["pack::narrative", "pattern::narrative_daily_routine", "topic::daily_routine"], "model": "qwen2.5:7b", "created_at": "2026-11-18T10:22:24+00:00"}
{"uid": "narrative_daily_routine-6dfc622abe", "scene": "narrative_daily_routine", "scene_zh": "叙事·日常作息", "scene_en": "Narrative: Daily Routine", "group": "个人叙事", "phase": 3, "micro": "weekend", "micro_zh": "周末", "zh": "我平时每天先喝一杯咖啡，下午再喝一杯。", "en": "I usually start my day with a cup of coffee, then have another one in the afternoon.", "sub": "每天喝两杯咖啡", "angle": "frequency adverb + sequence words (first, then)", "pack": "narrative", "pattern": "narrative_daily_routine", "topic": "daily_routine", "tags": ["pack::narrative", "pattern::narrative_daily_routine", "topic::daily_routine"], "model": "qwen2.5:7b", "created_at": "2026-11-18T10:22:24+00:00"}
{"uid": "narrative_daily_routine-1c37b638cd", "scene": "narrative_daily_routine", "scene_zh": "叙事·日常作息", "scene_en": "Narrative: Daily Routine", "group": "个人叙事", "phase": 3, "micro": "weekend", "micro_zh": "周末", "zh": "我通常十一点前上床，然后很快睡着。", "en": "I usually go to bed before eleven and fall asleep quickly.", "sub": "晚上十一点睡觉", "angle": "frequency adverb + sequence words (first, then)", "pack": "narrative", "pattern": "narrative_daily_routine", "topic": "daily_routine", "tags": ["pack::narrative", "pattern::narrative_daily_routine", "topic::daily_routine"], "model": "qwen2.5:7b", "created_at": "2026-11-18T10:22:24+00:00"}
{"uid": "narrative_daily_routine-cf597ee5ea", "scene": "narrative_daily_routine", "scene_zh": "叙事·日常作息", "scene_en": "Narrative: Daily Routine", "group": "个人叙事", "phase": 3, "micro": "weekend", "micro_zh": "周末", "zh": "我下班通常顺路买菜，然后回家做饭。", "en": "I usually buy groceries on my way home from work and then cook dinner.", "sub": "下班顺路买菜", "angle": "frequency adverb + sequence words (first, then)", "pack": "narrative", "pattern": "narrative_daily_routine", "topic": "daily_routine", "tags": ["pack::narrative", "pattern::narrative_daily_routine", "topic::daily_routine"], "model": "qwen2.5:7b", "created_at": "2026-11-18T10:22:24+00:00"}
{"uid": "narrative_daily_routine-bdfe588eba", "scene": "narrative_daily_routine", "scene_zh": "叙事·日常作息", "scene_en": "Narrative: Daily Routine", "group": "个人叙事", "phase": 3, "micro": "weekend", "micro_zh": "周末", "zh": "我通常周三晚上去健身房，练一个小时。", "en": "On Wednesday evenings, I usually go to the gym and work out for an hour.", "sub": "周三晚上去健身房", "angle": "frequency adverb + sequence words (first, then)", "pack": "narrative", "pattern": "narrative_daily_routine", "topic": "daily_routine", "tags": ["pack::narrative", "pattern::narrative_daily_routine", "topic::daily_routine"], "model": "qwen2.5:7b", "created_at": "2026-11-18T10:22:28+00:00"}
{"uid": "narrative_daily_routine-6981e980fc", "scene": "narrative_daily_routine", "scene_zh": "叙事·日常作息", "scene_en": "Narrative: Daily Routine", "group": "个人叙事", "phase": 3, "micro": "weekday", "micro_zh": "工作日", "zh": "我每天早上七点起床，先跑半小时，再回家洗澡。", "en": "I get up at seven every morning, run for half an hour, then shower at home.", "sub": "早上七点起床跑步", "angle": "frequency adverb + sequence words (first, then)", "pack": "narrative", "pattern": "narrative_daily_routine", "topic": "daily_routine", "tags": ["pack::narrative", "pattern::narrative_daily_routine", "topic::daily_routine"], "model": "qwen2.5:7b", "created_at": "2026-11-18T10:22:31+00:00"}
{"uid": "narrative_daily_routine-7ca576f137", "scene": "narrative_daily_routine", "scene_zh": "叙事·日常作息", "scene_en": "Narrative: Daily Routine", "group": "个人叙事", "phase": 3, "micro": "weekday", "micro_zh": "工作日", "zh": "我一般坐地铁上班，先听一会儿播客，然后看看新闻。", "en": "I usually take the subway to work, listen to a podcast for a while, then read the news.", "sub": "通勤路上听播客", "angle": "frequency adverb + sequence words (first, then)", "pack": "narrative", "pattern": "narrative_daily_routine", "topic": "daily_routine", "tags": ["pack::narrative", "pattern::narrative_daily_routine", "topic::daily_routine"], "model": "qwen2.5:7b", "created_at": "2026-11-18T10:22:33+00:00"}
{"uid": "narrative_daily_routine-a695e030b9", "scene": "narrative_daily_routine", "scene_zh": "叙事·日常作息", "scene_en": "Narrative: Daily Routine", "group": "个人叙事", "phase": 3, "micro": "weekday", "micro_zh": "工作日", "zh": "我平时通勤要一个小时，通常先听播客，再休息一会儿。", "en": "My commute takes an hour, I usually listen to podcasts first, then take a short break.", "sub": "通勤路上听播客", "angle": "frequency adverb + sequence words (first, then)", "pack": "narrative", "pattern": "narrative_daily_routine", "topic": "daily_routine", "tags": ["pack::narrative", "pattern::narrative_daily_routine", "topic::daily_routine"], "model": "qwen2.5:7b", "created_at": "2026-11-18T10:22:34+00:00"}
{"uid": "narrative_daily_routine-157ce09328", "scene": "narrative_daily_routine", "scene_zh": "叙事·日常作息", "scene_en": "Narrative: Daily Routine", "group": "个人叙事", "phase": 3, "micro": "weekday", "micro_zh": "工作日", "zh": "我中午通常和同事一起吃饭，然后散步。", "en": "I usually have lunch with my colleagues and then go for a walk.", "sub": "午休和同事吃饭", "angle": "frequency adverb + sequence words (first, then)", "pack": "narrative", "pattern": "narrative_daily_routine", "topic": "daily_routine", "tags": ["pack::narrative", "pattern::narrative_daily_routine", "topic::daily_routine"], "model": "qwen2.5:7b", "created_at": "2026-11-18T10:22:35+00:00"}
